{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 55, :comments ["<b>And her brother and her mother said.</b> Rashi explained: and Bethuel wanted to delay, and an angel came and killed him. And even though it is written above ״ויען לבן ובתואל״, it must be that he wanted to go back and delay the matter. Another explanation: they sought to feed Eliezer a deadly poison so that the money would remain theirs, and Gabriel came and switched the plate that had the poison, to give it to Eliezer, and it was given to Bethuel and he died."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:57.257050289Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}